This directory is intentionally empty and has no .env file. It's used as the
working directory for a second, zero-credential Inspector instance in
playwright.config.ts, so dotenv/config in src/index.ts finds nothing to
fall back to and the server genuinely has no LLM provider and no CSVBox
credentials configured — the only reliable way to exercise the
NO_LLM_PROVIDER and missing-CSVBox-credential error paths without a real
.env leaking a real key into those tests.
